From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: perlytiara <12584332+perlytiara@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:35:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Vault fork: the app is named Taviri

The owner picked the name Taviri (Tahitian for "key"). Name and package id
(io.github.perlytiara.taviri) change in vault/brand.properties; strings and
the login wordmark are regenerated from it. The version suffix now follows
the package id ("-taviri"). Icon and colours stay placeholders until the
brand kit exists; vault/tools/preview.py draws the current look.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
